  {
    "sha": "ab0d7898de6f5f2dd000c78fb64b8f47a75b7098",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOAOWUd9oAKGFiMGQ3ODk4ZGU2ZjVmMmRkMDAwYzc4ZmI2NGI4ZjQ3YTc1YjcwOTg",
    "commit": {
      "author": {
        "name": "Guillaume Lours",
        "email": "glours@users.noreply.github.com",
        "date": "2026-06-29T09:46:56Z"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "Guillaume Lours",
        "email": "705411+glours@users.noreply.github.com",
        "date": "2026-06-29T13:10:14Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(run): scope Running events to project.Services\n\nemitRunningEvents iterated the full ObservedState.Containers map,\nwhich is intentionally broader than the operation scope (it covers\nDisabledServices for orphan classification). compose run --no-deps\nSERVICE leaves project.Services empty and moves every other service\nto DisabledServices, so their running containers were reported as\nRunning even though this command must not manage them.\n\nFilter the iteration by project.Services, matching the reconciler\nscope, and document the contract on the function.\n\nFixes #13882\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Lours <glours@users.noreply.github.com>",
      "tree": {
