  {
    "sha": "55c61ceef90841544e1fb3d6285e2c612d2618f2",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOAOWUd9oAKDU1YzYxY2VlZjkwODQxNTQ0ZTFmYjNkNjI4NWUyYzYxMmQyNjE4ZjI",
    "commit": {
      "author": {
        "name": "Guillaume Lours",
        "email": "glours@users.noreply.github.com",
        "date": "2026-06-26T17:20:01Z"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "Guillaume Lours",
        "email": "705411+glours@users.noreply.github.com",
        "date": "2026-06-29T15:50:27Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(reconcile): hash resolved service refs to match executor\n\nThe reconciler hashed the raw service config while the executor\nhashed the form with network_mode/ipc/pid/volumes_from references\nresolved to container IDs. Persisted hash and recomputed hash\nnever matched, so dependents were recreated on every `up`.\n\nResolve references against observed containers before hashing,\nand cascade recreation to namespace-sharing dependents when a\nparent is replaced \u2014 otherwise the dependent would keep a stale\n\"container:<old_id>\" reference. Also dedup stops in\nplanStopDependents via stoppedByPlan: with the cascade restored,\nthe dependent would otherwise receive two Stop nodes.\n\nFixes #13878.\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Lours <glours@users.noreply.github.com>",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "fe304588c214a69802819b54ef86853266a6a01a",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/docker/compose/git/trees/fe304588c214a69802819b54ef86853266a6a01a"
